verb drum_timer_clears "Bongo Bongo drums; the hands beat on the drum is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 150
  take timer_drum
  unless phase_drum

verb atk_slam_down_timer_clears "The slamming hand lies on the floor is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 570
  take timer_atk_slam_down
  unless phase_atk_slam_down

verb down2_ready_timer_clears "Both hands down: the eye opens and Bongo Bongo readies its charge is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 1760
